      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A common possible slip here is to use the right rule on the wrong structure.\n\nFor this question:\n\nIf 2^(x-1) + 2^(x+1) = 20, what is x?\n\nStart from this clue:\nFactor out 2^(x-1).\n\nThen follow the second clue and solve only after the expression is rewritten correctly.",
